  "notes": "Tele System TS ON T2/HD (ONT2HD), Android TV 11 (SDK 30), firmware 20231013:user/release-keys\nSDMC ODM platform with Amlogic/droidlogic SoC, Italy/Europe DVB-T2 set-top box / TV.\n\nLive TV app: com.sdmc.tv (owns the digital tuner and leanback activity; set as live_tv_package).\nStock launcher: com.google.android.tvlauncher (classic Android TV home, disabled by launcher/build-and-install.sh).\n\nApply:   TV_HOST=<tv ip> tools/disable.sh examples/telesystem-ont2hd/debloat.txt\nUndo:    TV_HOST=<tv ip> tools/restore.sh examples/telesystem-ont2hd/debloat.txt\nEverything is DISABLED, not uninstalled. Comment out any line you want to keep.\n\nNotes on this device:\n- Connect over ADB: port 5555 is open when USB debugging is enabled in Developer Options.\n- The replacement launcher from launcher/ installs cleanly and takes Home without issues.\n- Live TV: com.sdmc.tv runs tuner playback and provides leanback launcher activity.\n- DO NOT DISABLE:\ncom.sdmc.tv                  Live TV tuner app\ncom.droidlogic.tvinput       HDMI and tuner input framework\ncom.sdmc.bluetoothconnect    Bluetooth remote pairing\ncom.sdmc.GlobalKey           Remote control hotkey handler\ncom.droidlogic.updater       Firmware OTA updates\nSDMC vendor bloat and diagnostics",
